---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { site } from "../site";
---

<Base title={`Changelog — ${site.name}`} description="Nothing has shipped. This page is honest about that.">
  <article class="prose wrap">
    <h1>Changelog</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      A list of versions, in the same way a closed kitchen has a menu.
    </p>

    <section class="entry">
      <h2>0.0.0 <time datetime="2026">Unreleased</time></h2>
      <p>The app is still in the kitchen. This page is the empty pass.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Added a changelog. Did not add the thing the changelog is for.</li>
        <li>Several windows were arranged, then the laptop closed.</li>
        <li>Hotkeys exist (⌃⌥1–9, capture, edit). They stay off until you enable them in Settings.</li>
        <li>If you came here out of habit, the news is: not yet.</li>
        <li>
          Follow <a href={site.xUrl}>@AppMise</a> if you like waiting with your windows already where they belong, in spirit.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>
